{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 16,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 140.015,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In the year that king Uzziah died, I saw also the Lord sitting upon a throne,",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.428,
      "end": 7.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "high and lifted up,",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.28,
      "end": 9.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his train filled the temple.",
      "verse": "16:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.91,
      "end": 12.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Above it stood the seraphim;",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.18,
      "end": 14.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "each one had six wings;",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.496,
      "end": 16.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with twain he covered his face,",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 16.812,
      "end": 18.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with twain he covered his feet,",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.128,
      "end": 21.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and with twain he did fly.",
      "verse": "16:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 21.712,
      "end": 24.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And one cried unto another, and said:",
      "verse": "16:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 24.353,
      "end": 26.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Holy, holy, holy, is the Lord of Hosts;",
      "verse": "16:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 26.948,
      "end": 29.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the whole earth is full of his glory.",
      "verse": "16:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 29.95,
      "end": 33.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the posts of the door moved at the voice of him that cried,",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 33.474,
      "end": 35.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the house was filled with smoke.",
      "verse": "16:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 36.29,
      "end": 37.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then said I:",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 37.77,
      "end": 39.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo is unto me! for I am undone;",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 40.179,
      "end": 42.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because I am a man of unclean lips;",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 42.82,
      "end": 46.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I dwell in the midst of a people of unclean lips;",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 46.204,
      "end": 49.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for mine eyes have seen the King, the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "16:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 50.321,
      "end": 54.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then flew one of the seraphim unto me, having a live coal in his hand,",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 55.145,
      "end": 58.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he had taken with the tongs from off the altar;",
      "verse": "16:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 58.844,
      "end": 61.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he laid it upon my mouth, and said:",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 61.532,
      "end": 63.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Lo, this has touched thy lips;",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 63.755,
      "end": 66.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thine iniquity is taken away,",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 66.396,
      "end": 68.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy sin purged.",
      "verse": "16:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 68.701,
      "end": 71.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Also I heard the voice of the Lord, saying:",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 71.528,
      "end": 73.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Whom shall I send,",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 73.241,
      "end": 74.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who will go for us?",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 76.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then I said:",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 76.48,
      "end": 78.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Here am I; send me.",
      "verse": "16:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 78.971,
      "end": 80.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 80.451,
      "end": 82.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go and tell this people\u2014",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 82.21,
      "end": 83.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Hear ye indeed,",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 83.644,
      "end": 85.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they understood not;",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 85.589,
      "end": 87.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and see ye indeed,",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 87.255,
      "end": 88.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they perceived not.",
      "verse": "16:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 89.468,
      "end": 91.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Make the heart of this people fat,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 92.109,
      "end": 93.781,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and make their ears heavy,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 93.961,
      "end": 95.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shut their eyes\u2014",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 95.488,
      "end": 97.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they see with their eyes,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 97.711,
      "end": 99.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hear with their ears,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 99.702,
      "end": 102.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and understand with their heart,",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 102.39,
      "end": 104.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be converted and be healed.",
      "verse": "16:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 105.438,
      "end": 106.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then said I:",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 106.918,
      "end": 108.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Lord, how long?",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 108.305,
      "end": 109.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 109.785,
      "end": 112.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Until the cities be wasted without inhabitant,",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 113.123,
      "end": 115.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the houses without man,",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 115.207,
      "end": 117.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the land be utterly desolate;",
      "verse": "16:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 118.163,
      "end": 120.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord have removed men far away,",
      "verse": "16:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 120.804,
      "end": 124.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there shall be a great forsaking in the midst of the land.",
      "verse": "16:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 125.106,
      "end": 127.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But yet there shall be a tenth,",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 127.515,
      "end": 129.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall return,",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 129.274,
      "end": 131.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be eaten, as a teil tree,",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 131.822,
      "end": 136.141,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as an oak whose substance is in them when they cast their leaves;",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 136.321,
      "end": 139.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so the holy seed shall be the substance thereof.",
      "verse": "16:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    }
  ]
}